Bank logos vendored for the Financials app (feature colors-and-icons)
=====================================================================

Origin
  Repository: https://github.com/Tgentil/Bancos-em-SVG (branch main)
  Commit consulted: fe1d43f0cf379135bd01c987bc147a04fdf48c6d
  (verified on 2026-10-06 with the GitHub API: the commit exists, is the head of main, and holds
  the four source files)

Files copied (source path in the repository -> file in this folder)
  Nu Pagamentos S.A/nubank-logo-fundo-roxo2021.svg      -> nubank.svg
  Banco Sofisa/logo-sofisa.svg                          -> sofisa-direto.svg
  Neon/header-logo-neon.svg                             -> neon.svg
  XP Investimentos/xp-investimentos-logo.svg            -> xp.svg

License
  The source repository has no license file. The project owner confirmed that using these
  files is acceptable for the personal use of this project. The brands and logos belong to
  their respective banks.

Edits made to the files (the drawings of the marks are not redrawn)
  - All four: removed the XML declaration, comments and editor metadata (sodipodi, inkscape,
    rdf, cc and dc elements, attributes and namespace declarations).
  - All four: recomposed on a square canvas, viewBox "0 0 2500 2500", with a full-bleed
    background rectangle in the brand color as the first element and no rounded corners of their
    own (the app frame rounds every icon the same way). Styles became presentation attributes.
  - nubank.svg: the background rectangle is now exactly the canvas, and the two purple paths
    that lay outside the canvas (negative coordinates, never visible) were removed.
  - sofisa-direto.svg: white full-bleed background (the mark was transparent); the mark is
    scaled to 72% and centered.
  - neon.svg: the wide wordmark (2500 x 543, previously cropped with a viewBox of
    "0 988.26 2500 543.48") is recomposed into the square: Neon blue (#0f92ff) full-bleed
    background, the wordmark in white (it was blue on transparent), scaled to 84% and centered.
  - xp.svg: black full-bleed background; the white "xp" is the cut-out of the original black
    shape, kept as drawn (the p still breaks out of the lower right edge) with a white fill
    behind the cut-out and the stem of the p extended to the bottom edge of the square.

Usage
  The files are imported by Vite and shown only through <img> (see BankIcon.tsx), never inlined.
  A test (banks.test.ts) checks size, viewBox and the absence of scripts and external
  references in every file of this folder.

Warning
  Any use beyond the personal use of this project (distribution, public deployment for other
  people, commercial use) requires reviewing the origin and the rights of these files first.
